= The Climate and Healthcare Bill

A scaled-down version of our agenda is within reach: climate investment, healthcare cost reductions, and a minimum tax on large corporations.

- @climate_pass: Pass it
- @climate_hold: Hold out for more

@climate_pass
on-arrival: climate_progress += 3; budget += 1; abundance_strength += 2; young_dem += 2*(1-dissent); progressive_dissent -= 3; inflation -= 0.3; healthcare_agenda += 1

The law passes narrowly. It is smaller than we wanted, but historic.

@climate_hold
on-arrival: progressive_dissent -= 1; moderate_dissent += 3; budget -= 0; polarization += 1

The window may close.
